// STATUS: ok
// A NUMBER literal outside the range of a double is valid: it denotes the
// nearest double to its decimal, which is an infinity far above the range and
// zero far below it (spec/01-lexical.md, the range of a Number literal).

// COVERS: number-literal-range far-above-range
print ;
// CHECK: inf

// COVERS: number-literal-range far-below-range
print 0.;
// CHECK: 0
